Modifications in this fork
--------------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 SeyanaA, released under the same MIT License.

  1. Entry moved to the left sidebar: a native "Web Chat" global-panel row
     directly under New Session (replaces the conversation-header icon).
     Clicking it opens (or reveals) the chat tab and returns the main column
     to the Conversation.
  2. Toolbar site selector: DeepSeek / ChatGPT / Gemini / Claude. Switching
     navigates the same native browser guest to the selected web chat; the
     choice is remembered.
  3. DeepSeek-only controls (context handoff, binding, binding status) are
     hidden while another site is selected.
  4. The host half now stores one login snapshot per site
     (session.json version 2; the version-1 DeepSeek snapshot is migrated
     automatically).
  5. Tab / guide copy generalized from "DeepSeek Web" to "Web Chat".

The exact code differences against the upstream 0.4.10 release are recorded
in docs/CHANGES-vs-upstream.diff.

